  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="detail">
        <p>Mrs Say, straw hat manufacturer, is listed at <ref target="civic?id=E.%20J.%20Prevot%20(11%20Madeline%20Street)">11 Madeline Street</ref> in the Sands &amp; McDougall directories from 1872 to 1878. From 1879 she is listed as a milliner in the same street, at No. 13 from 1890, and as Mrs E. B. Say in 1895 and 1900.</p>
        <p>A Mrs Say, milliner, is listed in <ref target="civic?id=Victoria%20Street">Victoria Street</ref> in 1860 and 1861, next to William B. Say, saddler. It isn't clear she is the same person.</p>
      </div>
    </body>
